      "identity_excerpt": "DURABLE POWER OF ATTORNEY FOR HEALTH CARE AND/OR HEALTH CARE DIRECTIVE OF (Print your full legal name here) ____________________________________________________________ (Address, City, State, Zip)_______________________________________________________________ (Pronouns and chosen name)________________________________________________________________________________________________ PART 1 - DURABLE POWER OF ATTORNEY FOR HEALTH CARE (If you DO NOT WISH to name someone to serve as your decision-making Agent, mark an “X” through Part 1 on pages 1 and 2 and continue on to Part 2.) 1. Selection of Agent. I, (your name printed) ________________________________________, currently a resident of __________________ County, Missouri, appoint the following person as my true and lawful attorney-in-fact (“Agent”): Name: Address: Phone(s): ____________________________________________________ ____________________________________________________ ____________________________________________________ 1st_______________________ 2nd______________________ 2. Alternate Agent. If my Agent resigns or is not able or available to make health care decisions for me, or if an Agent named by me is divorced from me or is my spouse and legally separated from me, I appoint the following persons in the order named below to serve as my alternate Agent and to have the same powers as my Agent: First Alternate Agent: Name: _____________________________________ Address: _____________________________________ _____________________________________ Phone(s): 1st __________________________________ 2nd __________________________________ 3. Durability. This is a Durable Power of Attorney, and the authority of my Agent, when effective, shall not terminate or be void or voidable if I am or become disabled or incapacitate",
